<title>FINLAND: Amer sees MacGregor price at FIM 90 mln.</title>
<headline>Amer sees MacGregor price at FIM 90 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish sporting goods and tobacco group Amer-yhtyma said on Tuesday it expected the receive some 90 million markka for its  MacGregor Golf Company which it is selling to Masters International Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;The estimated price for MacGregor Golf Company in the letter of intent is about 90 million markka,&quot; Amer said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said on Monday it would book a one-off loss of about 36 million markka from the sale of MacGregor.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
</text>
